#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatic Code Modifications {#automatic-code-modifications}"
msgstr "Mga Awtomatikong Pagbabago sa Code {#automatic-code-modifications}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"doQumentation automatically applies a small number of modifications to upstream\n"
"Qiskit tutorial and guide content to ensure a smooth, interactive experience.\n"
"This page documents every modification so you can understand exactly what\n"
"changed compared to the original IBM Quantum documentation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang doQumentation ay awtomatikong naglalapat ng kaunting mga pagbabago sa upstream\n"
"na nilalaman ng mga Qiskit tutorial at guide upang masiguro ang isang maayos at\n"
"interactive na karanasan. Dinodokumento ng pahinang ito ang bawat pagbabago upang\n"
"maintindihan mo nang eksakto kung ano ang nabago kumpara sa orihinal na IBM Quantum\n"
"documentation.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notebook copies (Open in Colab / Binder / Code Engine) {#notebook-copies-open-in-colab-binder-code-engine}"
msgstr "Mga kopya ng notebook (Open in Colab / Binder / Code Engine) {#notebook-copies-open-in-colab-binder-code-engine}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When you click **Open in Colab**, **Open in JupyterLab**, or **Open in Code\n"
"Engine**, you receive a copy of the original notebook with these additions:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kapag na-click mo ang **Open in Colab**, **Open in JupyterLab**, o **Open in Code\n"
"Engine**, makakatanggap ka ng kopya ng orihinal na notebook na may mga sumusunod\n"
"na karagdagan:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Setup notice cell (markdown) {#1-setup-notice-cell-markdown}"
msgstr "1. Setup notice cell (markdown) {#1-setup-notice-cell-markdown}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A blockquote cell is inserted at the very top explaining that doQumentation\n"
"added an automatic setup cell. It links back to this page.\n"
msgstr ""
"May ipinapasok na blockquote cell sa pinakatuktok na nagpapaliwanag na ang\n"
"doQumentation ay nagdagdag ng awtomatikong setup cell. Ito ay nag-uugnay pabalik\n"
"sa pahinang ito.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Prerequisites cell (code) {#2-prerequisites-cell-code}"
msgstr "2. Prerequisites cell (code) {#2-prerequisites-cell-code}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A code cell is inserted after the notice that:\n"
msgstr "May ipinapasok na code cell pagkatapos ng notice na:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Installs required packages** (`qiskit`, `qiskit-aer`, `qiskit-ibm-runtime`,\n"
"`pylatexenc`, plus any tutorial-specific packages detected via import\n"
"scanning). The install is **skipped** if packages are already present\n"
"(e.g. on Binder or Code Engine where they are pre-installed).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Nag-iinstall ng mga kinakailangang package** (`qiskit`, `qiskit-aer`, `qiskit-ibm-runtime`,\n"
"`pylatexenc`, kasama ang anumang tutorial-specific na package na natukoy sa pamamagitan\n"
"ng import scanning). Ang pag-install ay **nila-laktawan** kung ang mga package ay nakapuwesto na\n"
"(hal. sa Binder o Code Engine kung saan sila ay pre-installed).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Provides a commented-out credentials template** for IBM Quantum, so users\n"
"who want to run on real hardware can uncomment and fill in their API key.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Nagbibigay ng commented-out na credentials template** para sa IBM Quantum, kaya ang mga user\n"
"na gustong magpatakbo sa totoong hardware ay maaaring mag-uncomment at punan ang kanilang API key.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On Google Colab, this cell auto-runs on notebook open via the\n"
"`cell_execution_strategy: setup` metadata flag.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa Google Colab, ang cell na ito ay awtomatikong tumatakbo kapag binuksan ang notebook sa\n"
"pamamagitan ng `cell_execution_strategy: setup` metadata flag.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Image path rewrites {#3-image-path-rewrites}"
msgstr "3. Image path rewrites {#3-image-path-rewrites}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Relative image paths (`/docs/images/...`, `/learning/images/...`) are rewritten\n"
"to work correctly in standalone notebook environments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga relative image path (`/docs/images/...`, `/learning/images/...`) ay isinusulat muli\n"
"upang gumana nang tama sa mga standalone na notebook environment.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "MDX pages (in-browser rendering) {#mdx-pages-in-browser-rendering}"
msgstr "Mga MDX page (in-browser rendering) {#mdx-pages-in-browser-rendering}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The tutorials displayed on this website are converted from upstream `.ipynb`\n"
"notebooks or `.mdx` files. The following transforms are applied:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga tutorial na ipinapakita sa website na ito ay ina-convert mula sa upstream `.ipynb`\n"
"notebook o `.mdx` file. Ang mga sumusunod na transform ay inilalapat:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`pip install` lines** are added to Python code blocks that import\n"
"third-party packages, enabling one-click execution via thebelab.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`pip install` lines** ay idinadagdag sa mga Python code block na nag-iimport ng\n"
"third-party na package, na nagpapagana ng one-click execution sa pamamagitan ng thebelab.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Tutorial Survey section**: A note is appended clarifying the survey\n"
"belongs to IBM Quantum and linking to doQumentation's GitHub Issues for\n"
"site-specific feedback.\n"
msgstr ""
"**IBM Tutorial Survey section**: May idinaragdag na note na nililinaw na ang survey\n"
"ay nabibilang sa IBM Quantum at nag-uugnay sa GitHub Issues ng doQumentation para sa\n"
"feedback na partikular sa site.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Feedback widget**: A \"Was this helpful?\" widget is appended at the bottom\n"
"of each tutorial, tracked via privacy-friendly Umami analytics.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Feedback widget**: Isang \"Was this helpful?\" widget ang idinaragdag sa ibaba\n"
"ng bawat tutorial, sinusubaybayan sa pamamagitan ng privacy-friendly na Umami analytics.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**MDX syntax fixes**: Curly braces, heading hierarchy, and JSX compatibility\n"
"issues are automatically corrected for Docusaurus rendering.\n"
msgstr ""
"**MDX syntax fixes**: Ang mga curly brace, heading hierarchy, at JSX compatibility\n"
"issue ay awtomatikong itinutuwid para sa pag-render ng Docusaurus.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**OpenInLabBanner**: An interactive banner is injected below the title with\n"
"buttons to open the notebook in Colab, Binder, or Code Engine.\n"
msgstr ""
"**OpenInLabBanner**: Isang interactive na banner ang ipinapasok sa ibaba ng pamagat\n"
"na may mga button para buksan ang notebook sa Colab, Binder, o Code Engine.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is NOT modified {#what-is-not-modified}"
msgstr "Ano ang HINDI binabago {#what-is-not-modified}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The **tutorial content itself** (explanations, code logic, outputs) is never\n"
"altered.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang **mismong nilalaman ng tutorial** (mga paliwanag, code logic, output) ay hindi kailanman\n"
"binabago.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Original author attribution** is preserved via frontmatter and the NOTICE\n"
"file (Apache 2.0 / CC BY-SA 4.0 licenses).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang **orihinal na author attribution** ay napapanatili sa pamamagitan ng frontmatter at ng NOTICE\n"
"file (Apache 2.0 / CC BY-SA 4.0 licenses).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**No telemetry or tracking code** is injected into notebooks. Analytics\n"
"(Umami) only runs on the doQumentation website, not in exported notebooks.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Walang telemetry o tracking code** ang ipinapasok sa mga notebook. Ang Analytics\n"
"(Umami) ay tumatakbo lamang sa doQumentation website, hindi sa mga na-export na notebook.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Source code {#source-code}"
msgstr "Source code {#source-code}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All transformations are implemented in\n"
"[`scripts/sync-content.py`](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/blob/main/scripts/sync-content.py).\n"
msgstr ""
"Lahat ng transformation ay ipinatupad sa\n"
"[`scripts/sync-content.py`](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/blob/main/scripts/sync-content.py).\n"
